INSERT INTO blog_blogpost (title, content, created_at, updated_at) VALUES
('Introduction to Web Development', 'Web development is the process of building websites and web applications. It involves frontend development for user interfaces and backend development for server-side logic. Modern web development uses frameworks like React, Angular, and Django to streamline the process.', '2025-12-14 10:00:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:00:00.000000'),
('Understanding REST APIs', 'REST APIs provide a standardized way for applications to communicate over HTTP. They use standard HTTP methods like GET, POST, PUT, and DELETE to perform operations on resources. RESTful design principles make APIs predictable and easy to use.', '2025-12-14 10:05:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:05:00.000000'),
('Django ORM Best Practices', 'The Django ORM provides a powerful abstraction layer for database operations. Understanding how to use select_related and prefetch_related can significantly improve query performance. Always use migrations to manage schema changes.', '2025-12-14 10:10:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:10:00.000000'),
('Angular Component Architecture', 'Angular components are the building blocks of Angular applications. They encapsulate data, HTML template, and component logic. Understanding component lifecycle hooks and dependency injection is crucial for building maintainable applications.', '2025-12-14 10:15:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:15:00.000000'),
('Database Design Fundamentals', 'Good database design is essential for application performance and maintainability. Normalization helps reduce data redundancy, while proper indexing improves query speed. Always consider relationships between entities when designing schemas.', '2025-12-14 10:20:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:20:00.000000'),
('Git Workflow Strategies', 'Effective Git workflows help teams collaborate efficiently. Branching strategies like Git Flow or GitHub Flow provide structure for managing code changes. Always write clear commit messages and use pull requests for code review.', '2025-12-14 10:25:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:25:00.000000'),
('Testing in Django', 'Django provides excellent testing tools through its TestCase class. Unit tests verify individual components, while integration tests check how components work together. Aim for high test coverage but focus on testing critical business logic.', '2025-12-14 10:30:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:30:00.000000'),
('TypeScript for JavaScript Developers', 'TypeScript adds static typing to JavaScript, catching errors at compile time. Understanding interfaces, types, and generics helps build more robust applications. TypeScript integrates seamlessly with Angular and modern JavaScript frameworks.', '2025-12-14 10:35:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:35:00.000000'),
('API Security Best Practices', 'Securing APIs is crucial for protecting user data and preventing attacks. Use HTTPS, implement authentication and authorization, validate all inputs, and protect against common vulnerabilities like SQL injection and XSS attacks.', '2025-12-14 10:40:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:40:00.000000'),
('Responsive Web Design', 'Responsive design ensures websites work well on all device sizes. Use CSS media queries, flexible grid layouts, and responsive images. Mobile-first approach helps prioritize performance and user experience on smaller screens.', '2025-12-14 10:45:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:45:00.000000'),
('Docker Containerization', 'Docker simplifies application deployment by packaging applications and dependencies into containers. Understanding Dockerfiles, docker-compose, and container orchestration helps streamline development and deployment workflows.', '2025-12-14 10:50:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:50:00.000000'),
('State Management in Angular', 'Managing application state effectively is crucial for complex Angular applications. Services, RxJS observables, and state management libraries like NgRx provide different approaches. Choose the right solution based on application complexity.', '2025-12-14 10:55:00.000000', '2025-12-14 10:55:00.000000'),
('Performance Optimization Techniques', 'Optimizing application performance improves user experience and reduces server costs. Techniques include database query optimization, caching strategies, code splitting, lazy loading, and minimizing bundle sizes.', '2025-12-14 11:00:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:00:00.000000'),
('Error Handling Strategies', 'Proper error handling improves application reliability and user experience. Implement error boundaries, provide meaningful error messages, log errors for debugging, and handle edge cases gracefully.', '2025-12-14 11:05:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:05:00.000000'),
('Code Review Guidelines', 'Code reviews improve code quality and knowledge sharing. Review for correctness, performance, security, and maintainability. Provide constructive feedback and be open to suggestions from reviewers.', '2025-12-14 11:10:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:10:00.000000'),
('Short', 'Brief content.', '2025-12-14 11:15:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:15:00.000000'),
('Medium Length Title Example', 'This is a medium length content example that provides more context than a short post but is not overly verbose. It demonstrates how medium-length content appears in the UI.', '2025-12-14 11:20:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:20:00.000000'),
('This is a Very Long Title That Goes On and On to Test How the UI Handles Longer Titles Properly', 'This is a very long content paragraph that goes on and on. It should test how the UI handles longer content when displayed in the list view versus when expanded. This content is repeated multiple times to create a longer post. This is a very long content paragraph that goes on and on. It should test how the UI handles longer content when displayed in the list view versus when expanded. This content is repeated multiple times to create a longer post. This is a very long content paragraph that goes on and on. It should test how the UI handles longer content when displayed in the list view versus when expanded.', '2025-12-14 11:25:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:25:00.000000'),
