('Post Title', 'Some content here.', '2025-12-14 11:35:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:35:00.000000'),
('Another Blog Post', 'More content for this post.', '2025-12-14 11:40:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:40:00.000000'),
('Yet Another Post', 'Even more content.', '2025-12-14 11:45:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:45:00.000000'),
('Short Title', 'Short.', '2025-12-14 11:50:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:50:00.000000'),
('Long Title That Should Wrap or Truncate Properly in the UI', 'Long content that should be truncated in the list view. This is the full content that should appear when expanded. Long content that should be truncated in the list view. This is the full content that should appear when expanded. Long content that should be truncated in the list view. This is the full content that should appear when expanded.', '2025-12-14 11:55:00.000000', '2025-12-14 11:55:00.000000'),
('Modern JavaScript Features', 'ES6+ introduced many powerful features like arrow functions, destructuring, async/await, and template literals. These features make JavaScript more expressive and easier to work with. Understanding these features is essential for modern web development.', '2025-12-14 12:00:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:00:00.000000'),
('CSS Grid and Flexbox', 'CSS Grid and Flexbox revolutionized layout design in CSS. Grid is perfect for two-dimensional layouts, while Flexbox excels at one-dimensional layouts. Mastering both tools enables creating complex, responsive designs efficiently.', '2025-12-14 12:05:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:05:00.000000'),
('Authentication and Authorization', 'Implementing secure authentication and authorization is critical for web applications. Use industry-standard protocols like OAuth 2.0, implement proper session management, and always hash passwords. Role-based access control helps manage permissions effectively.', '2025-12-14 12:10:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:10:00.000000'),
('Microservices Architecture', 'Microservices break applications into smaller, independent services. This architecture improves scalability and allows teams to work independently. However, it also introduces complexity in deployment, monitoring, and inter-service communication.', '2025-12-14 12:15:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:15:00.000000'),
('CI/CD Pipelines', 'Continuous Integration and Continuous Deployment automate testing and deployment processes. Setting up CI/CD pipelines reduces manual errors and enables faster releases. Popular tools include GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, and Jenkins.', '2025-12-14 12:20:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:20:00.000000'),
('Database Migrations', 'Migrations track database schema changes over time. They enable version control for database structure and make deployments reproducible. Always test migrations in development before applying to production.', '2025-12-14 12:25:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:25:00.000000'),
('RxJS Observables', 'RxJS provides powerful tools for handling asynchronous operations in Angular. Observables enable reactive programming patterns. Understanding operators like map, filter, and switchMap helps build responsive applications.', '2025-12-14 12:30:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:30:00.000000'),
('API Documentation', 'Good API documentation helps developers understand and use your API effectively. Use tools like Swagger or OpenAPI to generate interactive documentation. Include examples, error responses, and authentication requirements.', '2025-12-14 12:35:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:35:00.000000'),
('Frontend Build Tools', 'Build tools like Webpack, Vite, and Parcel transform and bundle code for production. Understanding how these tools work helps optimize build times and bundle sizes. Source maps aid in debugging production code.', '2025-12-14 12:40:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:40:00.000000'),
('Backend Caching Strategies', 'Caching improves application performance by storing frequently accessed data. Implement caching at multiple levels: database queries, API responses, and static assets. Choose appropriate cache invalidation strategies to ensure data consistency.', '2025-12-14 12:45:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:45:00.000000'),
('User Experience Design', 'Good UX design focuses on user needs and creates intuitive interfaces. Consider user flows, accessibility, and responsive design. User testing helps validate design decisions and identify pain points.', '2025-12-14 12:50:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:50:00.000000'),
('Version Control Best Practices', 'Effective version control practices improve collaboration and code quality. Use meaningful commit messages, create feature branches, and keep commits focused. Regular pulls and merges prevent integration conflicts.', '2025-12-14 12:55:00.000000', '2025-12-14 12:55:00.000000'),
('Debugging Techniques', 'Effective debugging saves time and reduces frustration. Use browser dev tools, logging, breakpoints, and error tracking services. Understanding stack traces and error messages helps quickly identify and fix issues.', '2025-12-14 13:00:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:00:00.000000'),
('Code Organization Patterns', 'Well-organized code is easier to maintain and understand. Follow consistent naming conventions, group related functionality, and separate concerns. Design patterns provide proven solutions to common problems.', '2025-12-14 13:05:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:05:00.000000'),
('Load Balancing Strategies', 'Load balancing distributes traffic across multiple servers, improving performance and reliability. Different algorithms suit different scenarios. Health checks ensure traffic only goes to healthy servers.', '2025-12-14 13:10:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:10:00.000000'),
('Monitoring and Logging', 'Comprehensive monitoring and logging help identify issues and understand system behavior. Track key metrics, set up alerts, and maintain detailed logs. Tools like Prometheus and ELK stack provide powerful monitoring solutions.', '2025-12-14 13:15:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:15:00.000000'),
('Security Headers', 'Security headers protect applications from common attacks. Headers like Content-Security-Policy, X-Frame-Options, and Strict-Transport-Security add important security layers. Configure these headers properly in your web server or application.', '2025-12-14 13:20:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:20:00.000000'),
('Async Programming', 'Asynchronous programming enables non-blocking operations, improving application responsiveness. Understanding promises, async/await, and event loops helps build efficient applications. Handle errors properly in async code.', '2025-12-14 13:25:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:25:00.000000'),
('Database Indexing', 'Proper indexing significantly improves query performance. Index frequently queried columns and foreign keys. However, too many indexes can slow down write operations. Monitor query performance to identify indexing needs.', '2025-12-14 13:30:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:30:00.000000'),
('API Rate Limiting', 'Rate limiting protects APIs from abuse and ensures fair resource usage. Implement rate limits based on user, IP, or endpoint. Provide clear error messages when limits are exceeded and consider different limits for different user tiers.', '2025-12-14 13:35:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:35:00.000000'),
('Component Communication', 'Effective component communication is essential in Angular applications. Use @Input and @Output for parent-child communication, services for sibling components, and state management for complex scenarios. Choose the right approach for each situation.', '2025-12-14 13:40:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:40:00.000000'),
('Database Transactions', 'Transactions ensure data consistency by grouping related operations. Use transactions for operations that must succeed or fail together. Understand isolation levels and handle transaction errors appropriately.', '2025-12-14 13:45:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:45:00.000000'),
('Progressive Web Apps', 'PWAs combine web and mobile app experiences. They work offline, can be installed, and provide app-like interactions. Service workers enable offline functionality and background sync.', '2025-12-14 13:50:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:50:00.000000'),
('Code Refactoring', 'Refactoring improves code quality without changing functionality. Regular refactoring prevents technical debt accumulation. Focus on improving readability, reducing complexity, and eliminating duplication.', '2025-12-14 13:55:00.000000', '2025-12-14 13:55:00.000000'),
('API Versioning', 'API versioning allows evolving APIs without breaking existing clients. Use URL versioning, header versioning, or content negotiation. Maintain backward compatibility when possible and communicate breaking changes clearly.', '2025-12-14 14:00:00.000000', '2025-12-14 14:00:00.000000'),
('Frontend Routing', 'Client-side routing enables single-page application navigation. Angular Router provides powerful routing features including lazy loading, guards, and resolvers. Design routes to reflect application structure.', '2025-12-14 14:05:00.000000', '2025-12-14 14:05:00.000000'),
('Data Validation', 'Input validation prevents invalid data from entering the system. Validate on both client and server side. Provide clear validation error messages and validate data types, formats, and business rules.', '2025-12-14 14:10:00.000000', '2025-12-14 14:10:00.000000'),
('Performance Metrics', 'Measuring performance helps identify bottlenecks and track improvements. Monitor metrics like page load time, time to interactive, and API response times. Use tools like Lighthouse and WebPageTest for analysis.', '2025-12-14 14:15:00.000000', '2025-12-14 14:15:00.000000'),
('Dependency Management', 'Managing dependencies effectively prevents security vulnerabilities and compatibility issues. Keep dependencies updated, audit for vulnerabilities, and understand what each dependency does. Use lock files to ensure consistent installs.', '2025-12-14 14:20:00.000000', '2025-12-14 14:20:00.000000'),
('Accessibility Best Practices', 'Accessible websites work for all users, including those with disabilities. Use semantic HTML, provide alt text for images, ensure keyboard navigation, and maintain sufficient color contrast. Test with screen readers.', '2025-12-14 14:25:00.000000', '2025-12-14 14:25:00.000000'),
('Cloud Deployment', 'Cloud platforms simplify deployment and scaling. Understand different service models: IaaS, PaaS, and SaaS. Configure auto-scaling, load balancing, and monitoring. Use infrastructure as code for reproducible deployments.', '2025-12-14 14:30:00.000000', '2025-12-14 14:30:00.000000'),
('Code Documentation', 'Good documentation helps developers understand and maintain code. Write clear comments explaining why, not what. Maintain README files, API documentation, and architecture diagrams. Keep documentation up to date with code changes.', '2025-12-14 14:35:00.000000', '2025-12-14 14:35:00.000000');
